# Files and folders excluded from the distributed plugin zip.
#
# `wp-scripts plugin-zip` (the `npm run build` step) honors this file, so anything
# listed here is kept OUT of the production archive that ships to WordPress.org.
# This is the single source of truth for packaging — `.gitattributes` export-ignore
# only affects GitHub's "Source code" download, not this build or the SVN release.
#
# Keep this in sync with the dev-only paths in `.gitattributes`.

# --- Build output & OS/editor junk (these caused Plugin Check failures) ---
/build
*.zip
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Version control & CI ---
.git
.github
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.distignore

# --- Dev tooling & dependencies ---
/node_modules
package.json
package-lock.json
composer.json
composer.lock
webpack.config.js
phpcs.xml
.phpcs.xml
phpcs.xml.dist

# --- Sources & tests (only built assets ship) ---
/src
/tests

# --- Project docs not meant for end users (readme.txt still ships) ---
/docs
README.md
/ROADMAP.md
/RELEASE-COMPARISON-1.0.2-to-1.1.0.md
/RELEASE-COMPARISON-1.1.0-to-1.1.1.md
